    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superb three bedroom mid terrace home with a light filled extension and a large back garden ideally located in a quiet cul-de-sac.\n\nThis charming property features a spacious driveway leading to an attractive façade. The entrance hall has understairs storage and laminate floors which continue to the former parlour room which could be used as a living room, playroom, home office or even a guest bedroom. The spacious family room is the perfect place to relax & entertain and boasts a feature fireplace and frosted glass blocks. The light filled open plan kitchen & dining area has been cleverly extended to maximise space. The high spec L shaped kitchen enjoys splashback tiling and plenty of counter & cupboard space. The kitchen also benefits from having a separate utility room ideally positioned next to it. The generous sized family bathroom completes the downstairs accommodation and has a tiled floor, partially tiled walls, built-in storage and an electric shower. A rear hallway opens to a large back garden (approx. 18x6 meters) which has a purpose built garden shed which is ideal for storage and could also make an excellent workshop or gym. Upstairs consists of three bedrooms and a second bathroom. All three bedrooms have laminate floors, while the main bedroom incorporates the hotpress. The second bathroom is fully tiled and has an electric shower. \n\n27 Galtymore Close is ideally located in a quiet cul-de-sac just a short stroll from The Grand Canal and the Blackhorse LUAS stop and a bus stop which provides easy access to the city centre. There are plenty of shops, cafes bars & restaurants nearby. There are also lots of schools, sports clubs, parks and playground in the area. The new children's hospital at St. James's is also within walking distance.\n\nFeatures:\nYear of construction 1947\nCul-de-sac\nLarge driveway\nSpacious extension\nUtility room\n2 bathrooms\nAmazing garden & shed\nHigh spec kitchen\nSought after location\nParlour room\n"
      },
